{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33748","headline":"七爱诗 李太尉 · 皮日休","name":"七爱诗 李太尉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾爱李太尉，崛起定中原。\n骁雄十万兵，四面围国门。\n一战取王畿，一叱散妖氛。\n乘舆既反正，凶竖争亡魂。\n巍巍柱天功，荡荡盖世勳。\n仁於曹孟德，勇过霍将军。\n丹券入帑藏，青史传子孙。\n所谓大丈夫，动合惊乾坤。\n所谓圣天子，难得忠贞臣。\n下以契鱼水，上以合风云。\n百世必一乱，千年方一人。\n吾虽翰墨子，气概敢不羣。\n愿以太平颂，题向甘泉春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}